flowchart TD
  Start((Continue from Part 1)) --> Hosted[Customer pays on Stripe hosted page]
  Hosted --> Paid{Stripe event reports paid?}
  Paid -- No --> Cancel[Return to checkout; no order created]
  Cancel --> EndNo((End: no order))
  Paid -- Yes --> Hook[Webhook verifies Stripe signature]
  Hook --> Signature{Signature valid?}
  Signature -- No --> Reject[Reject webhook with HTTP 400]
  Signature -- Yes --> Duplicate{Payment already has an order?}
  Duplicate -- Yes --> Existing[Reuse existing order]
  Duplicate -- No --> Create[Create Sanity order]
  Create --> Stock[Decrement stock in Sanity transaction]
  Stock --> Email[Claim and send confirmation email]
  Existing --> Email
  Email --> EndOrder((Order recorded; continue to Part 3))
